  "statuteText": "659:54-a Immaterial Defects; Electronically Transmitted Absentee Ballots. –\n\nNo electronically transmitted absentee ballot shall be rejected by the moderator for any ballot, envelope, or affidavit weight, size, or color, or any ink font size, alignment, or color."
